{"4607170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sterile Childhood: Case 17", "steam_appid": 4607170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital once wrote you into a case file. Now you must recover the life it erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a sealed, abandoned hospital annex. You have no name, no memory, and only one clue: you were once recorded as Case 17. This place was once used for children’s observation, treatment, and behavioral correction. It has long been deserted, but its sealed files, residual systems, and altered records are still waiting to be reopened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dim hospital wards, silent corridors, and archive rooms. Search through torn medical records, unlock sealed doors and files, and piece together what really happened inside the facility. When avoidance is no longer possible, survive turn-based card encounters against distorted figures still bound to the hospital’s old system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl keeps appearing at the edge of your vision. She may be guiding you out — or leading you toward a past you were never meant to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You were once one of its cases</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/7a29803400e11d8c6638965a89f69ef0.avif?t=1786846868\" width=1098 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital once recorded, evaluated, and rewrote you. As you explore, sealed medical files, access logs, and the “Clinical Audit Report” gradually reveal your past as Case 17. You are not investigating a stranger’s story — you are recovering the parts of yourself that were erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore sealed wards and archive rooms</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/a1410f0e32353868ff48043165d8d1a2.avif?t=1786846868\" width=1110 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through abandoned corridors, children’s wards, archive rooms, and sealed medical areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Survive card-based psychological encounters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/43184346599ffa5022255ac92b2732b2.poster.avif?t=1786846868\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/43184346599ffa5022255ac92b2732b2.webm?t=1786846868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/43184346599ffa5022255ac92b2732b2.mp4?t=1786846868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When avoidance is no longer possible, face distorted figures such as the “IV Stand Patient” and the “Ward Rounds Director” in turn-based encounters. Use cards to defend yourself, endure pressure, and find the right moment to strike back while balancing Self and Breakdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fragmented records and hidden truths</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/46d6b32b7b93fd41bf3e361943ad7795.avif?t=1786846868\" width=1094 height=498 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect keycards, torn reports, and altered medical files. Unlock deeper areas of the hospital and reconstruct the truth from scattered fragments, recovering a life that was sealed, rewritten, and forced to be forgotten.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital once wrote you into a case file. Now you must recover the life it erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up inside a sealed, abandoned hospital annex. You have no name, no memory, and only one clue: you were once recorded as Case 17. This place was once used for children’s observation, treatment, and behavioral correction. It has long been deserted, but its sealed files, residual systems, and altered records are still waiting to be reopened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dim hospital wards, silent corridors, and archive rooms. Search through torn medical records, unlock sealed doors and files, and piece together what really happened inside the facility. When avoidance is no longer possible, survive turn-based card encounters against distorted figures still bound to the hospital’s old system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious girl keeps appearing at the edge of your vision. She may be guiding you out — or leading you toward a past you were never meant to remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>You were once one of its cases</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607170/extras/7a29803400e11d8c6638965a89f69ef0.avif?t=1786846868\" width=1098 height=546 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital once recorded, evaluated, and rewrote you. As you explore, sealed medical files, access logs, and the “Clinical Audit Report” gradually reveal your past as Case 17. You are not investigating a stranger’s story — you are recovering the parts of yourself that were erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"